    label: 'Ideal for those who want to:',
    statement: 'Celebrate a milestone through an editorial series. Feed multiple communication channels.',
  },
]

// Fed to PhasesScroll only — bullet lists from the source doc's "Como
// implementamos" condensed into one sentence per phase. Six phases, matching
// the doc: Editorial Strategy and Concept & Identity are two distinct steps.
//
// LENGTH BUDGET: PhasesScroll's pinned rows are a FIXED height by design
// (--phase-row-h keeps the active row parked in a constant slot), which
// leaves descriptions ~3 rendered lines — about 125 characters at the
// desktop column width — before `overflow: hidden` shears the last line.
// Titles get 2 lines in a ~317px column. Keep new copy inside that budget
// rather than growing the row: the fixed height is what the slide depends on.
const approachSteps = [
  {
    number: '— 01',
    title: 'Editorial Strategy',
    description:
      "We define the series' positioning: a strategic diagnostic session, objectives, audience and key messages, episode structure and format, themes, guests, editorial calendar and distribution plan.",
  },
  {
    number: '— 02',
    title: 'Concept & Identity',
    description:
